  "decision_conditions": [
    "Due to insufficient and incomplete information regarding the overall development, which would also combine previous proposals 25/01795/CPUF and 25/01800/PAEXTF, Officers cannot fully assess the overall impact on the character and appearance of the host dwelling and the surrounding area, or on the amenities of occupiers at No. 32 Beverley Way. Additionally, the proposed insufficient set down of the roof over the two-story side extension from the original roof line and the proposed fenestration would contradict Policy Guidance 39, adversely affecting the overall design. As such, the proposal is in conflict with Paragraph 135 of the National Planning Policy Framework 2024, Policies D3 of the London Plan 2021, and Policy DM10 of the Council's Core Strategy 2012.\r"
  ],
